## Deployed Version

The application is live and accessible at:
**https://foresightwallet.onrender.com**

Markers can register a new account and test the application directly via the URL above without any local setup.

> **Note:** The app is hosted on Render's free tier and may take 30–60 seconds to wake up on first load if it has been inactive.